      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DEWANA MISSILE (1) has an excellent record over this course and distance having never missed the placings in three starts, including two wins. Was out of the placings last time (25.94) at Geelong in a Special conditions H, finishing fifth and beaten 6 lengths. Rates on top and should go close. LOCO DOMINATOR (2) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by 7 lengths at The Meadows in a handy 30.39 beating Reuben Hill. Has a strong record from this draw, notching three wins and two minor placings from five starts. Sure to measure up. LAKEVIEW CINDY (6) brought up her 7th career win last start at The Meadows (30.17). Was a winner at her only start from this draw. One of main contenders. PAW BRUTUS (8) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
